# Governance changes

- Apply `governance/15-document-governance.md`.
- Preserve Document ID, owner, approver, status and version.
- Explain the trigger and impact on templates, rules, skills, CI and active Outcomes.
- Update `governance/document-control.yaml` when metadata changes.
- OpenSpace may supply evidence or a proposal, never automatic approval or merge.
